    "Name": "Klyf",
    "Details": "The Klyf Support Transport Vehicle is an updated design of the original SLDF Titanhaulers brought during the exodus. It fills a similar role of a highly armored cargo hauler with enough weapons to defend itself against unorganized attacks during convoys in remote locations.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       215     40\n<b>Left</b>         175     40\n<b>Right</b>       175     40\n<b>Rear</b>        140     40\n<b>Turret</b>      175     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      880    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Rugged</color>",
